ildren has  decreased by 90 now if a 1970s teenager  could travel a few miles from home alone  then in 2020 the radius of his  independent movements is measured simply  in tens of yards  in my country the situation is very  similar in the 70s 80 percent of third  graders went to school on foot now only  one child out of 10 is allowed to do  this  for good or not we have begun to pay  much more attention to the safety of our  children some older people even call it  overprotective and call for giving  teenagers more freedom  it is all the more surprising that in a  digital space we take care of our  children much less according to  developer statistics 60 of parents set  restrictions on watching videos and  games are limited only in half of the  cases unfortunately in most cases even  advanced parental control systems give  only the illusion of security to the  parents on the other hand the future  belongs to them the alpha generation and  it's hardly worth imposing the old rules  of behavior on those who unlike you know  the history of 4 nn1 and what vault 8166  is a child is a beam of sunlight from  the infinite and eternal with  possibilities of both virtue and vice  but as yet unstained  my name is bradley and thanks for  joining us i'll see you next video  [Music]  you
 

